olivia: Keep it simple in samplekit (1 retry + backoff) — we shouldn't bake full retry policies into the demo. Add a comment pointing to Redwood Optimize docs for production retry strategies.

kevin: Updated: implement 2 retries with 100ms -> 300ms backoff. Pushed.

