maria: Thanks team — can we also add a small note in the onboarding checklist that samplekit includes the withAuthRetry pattern and where to find it? New hires keep re-implementing it.

kevin: Yup will add to onboarding doc. Also added a short eval harness snippet to the repo that asserts embeddings parity between server and client flows (basic smoke check).

olivia: Great. This should reduce friction for folks using Next.js starters and embedding features. :thumbsup:

sanjay: If anyone wants to further harden, we can add a server-side caching layer for embeddings in the samplekit to reduce calls during token churn. But that can be a follow-up.

